@NotificationService.Presentation_HostAddress = http://localhost:5069
@accessToken = {{accessToken}}
@notificationId = {{notificationId}}

###

GET {{NotificationService.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

POST {{NotificationService.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
